<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct nickel imports down 23.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct nickel imports down 23.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined nickel imports totalled 4,716 tonnes in October, down by 23.8 percent from 6,189 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>Details were as follows (on a customs-cleared basis, in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Oct 96	 Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Total	   4,716	  3,793	 6,189</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	    657	    595	 2,388</p>
<p> S. Africa	 310	    210	   320</p>
<p> Zimbabwe	  757	    484	   717</p>
<p>Imports in the first 10 months of 1996 totalled 46,197 tonnes, against 60,171 tonnes in the same period the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3 3432 7391</p>
</text>
